  "solution": "**Explanation:**\n\nThe logic followed here is:\n\n(First number) × 6 + 1 = Second number\n\n(First number) × 7 + 1 = Third number\n\n⇒ (9, 55, 64) → 9 × 6 + 1 = 54 + 1 **= 55**; 9 × 7 + 1 = 63 + 1 **= 64**\n\n⇒ (7, 43, 50) → 7 × 6 + 1 = 42 + 1 **= 43**; 7 × 7 + 1 = 49 + 1 **= 50**\n\nLet's check each option:\n\n1. (7, 42, 50) → 7 × 6 + 1 = 42 + 1 = 43 **≠ 42**; 7 × 7 + 1 = 49 + 1 = 50 \n\n2. (8, 32, 41) → 8 × 6 + 1 = 48 + 1 = 49 **≠ 32**; 8 × 7 + 1 = 56 + 1 = 57 **≠ 41**\n\n3. (6, 17, 21) → 6 × 6 + 1 = 36 + 1 = 37 ≠ 17; 6 × 7 + 1 = 42 + 1 = 43 ≠ 21 \n\n4. (5, 31, 36) → 5 × 6 + 1 = 30 + 1 = **31**; 5 × 7 + 1 = 35 + 1 = **36** \n\nHence, 'option 4)' is the correct answer.",
